WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.478
Welcome to Lead Velocity.

00:00:01.478 --> 00:00:06.445
This guide walks you through onboarding and how your Sort My Cover leads reach you.

00:00:06.445 --> 00:00:08.988
It applies whichever plan you have chosen.

00:00:08.988 --> 00:00:12.831
Your agreement and invoice set out your own allocation and fees.

00:00:12.831 --> 00:00:16.320
Let's get your practice ready for the right conversations.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:22.687
Start by reviewing your agreement, completing the relevant details and returning the signed PDF.

00:00:22.687 --> 00:00:28.899
Pay your invoice using its banking details and payment reference, then send us your proof of payment.

00:00:28.899 --> 00:00:32.676
We begin working on your campaign once payment has been made.

00:00:32.676 --> 00:00:37.000
Campaign activation follows onboarding and the final readiness checks.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.822
We provide your broker portal login details separately.

00:00:40.822 --> 00:00:44.665
Sign in through the broker portal on the Lead Velocity website.

00:00:44.665 --> 00:00:50.489
Your account is linked to your practice, so you see your own leads and can track their progress.

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:55.712
Keep your login private, and use the password recovery option if you need to reset it.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:02.424
Next, confirm your practice details and the WhatsApp number you want us to use for lead notifications.

00:01:02.424 --> 00:01:06.972
Share a short biography and a clear photograph for your introduction card.

00:01:06.972 --> 00:01:10.670
We can use initials while your photograph is being arranged.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.641
An introduction video or voice note is optional.

00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:16.976
We will guide you through approving your introduction.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:21.930
Tell us your working hours, preferred appointment methods and availability.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.430
Where applicable, connect your calendar with our guidance.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.287
Keep your availability up to date and let us know about changes.

00:01:29.287 --> 00:01:37.712
Before going live, we check the agreed booking arrangements and notification channels together, so appointments can fit around your practice.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.538
Whichever tier you choose, the majority of your plan fee goes towards advertising.

00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:54.198
The rest supports the service that turns interest into a useful conversation: campaign creative, WhatsApp nurturing, booking support, reminders and our team's work.

00:01:54.198 --> 00:01:58.720
Your specific fee and lead allocation remain those in your agreement.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:02.144
We will not assume every broker has the same budget.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:07.324
The client first shows interest through a Sort My Cover campaign or enquiry.

00:02:07.324 --> 00:02:16.489
With their consent, our WhatsApp process follows up, helps establish their needs and moves the conversation towards an appointment where appropriate.

00:02:16.489 --> 00:02:23.272
We introduce the adviser and provide the agreed lead information, so you have context before you make contact.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:29.244
Clients receive consistent WhatsApp follow-up, notifications and appointment reminders.

00:02:29.244 --> 00:02:34.188
They can opt in or opt out at any time, and can tell us if their plans change.

00:02:34.188 --> 00:02:40.634
That ongoing contact helps us identify attendance concerns ahead of the appointment wherever possible.

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:45.640
It supports attendance, but it cannot guarantee that every client will show up.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:52.028
If a client does not attend, our first priority is to do our best to reschedule the appointment.

00:02:52.028 --> 00:02:57.774
If that does not work, we replace the lead in line with the goodwill terms in your agreement.

00:02:57.774 --> 00:03:05.048
This is a goodwill gesture because our nurturing process already works to keep clients engaged and flag changes early.

00:03:05.048 --> 00:03:09.632
We stand behind that process and work with you to recover the opportunity.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:15.772
Once a lead reaches you, follow up promptly and keep its progress up to date in your portal.

00:03:15.772 --> 00:03:19.432
Record the outcome and share useful feedback with our team.

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:23.703
That helps us understand what is working and where support is needed.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:31.328
Your own advice, quotations and client relationship remain your responsibility as the financial adviser or insurance broker.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:37.861
Your next steps are simple: sign your agreement, pay your invoice and complete onboarding with us.

00:03:37.861 --> 00:03:41.793
We will confirm campaign activation after the readiness checks.

00:03:41.793 --> 00:03:48.489
If you need help, email howzit at lead velocity dot co dot zed ay, or reply to your onboarding conversation.

00:03:48.489 --> 00:03:49.472
Welcome aboard.

00:03:49.472 --> 00:03:52.360
We look forward to helping your practice grow.

